# CI Build Process

A typical Jenkins + Maven CI process:

```text
GitHub Repository
       |
       v
Jenkins
       |
       v
Checkout Source Code
       |
       v
Maven
       |
       +---- Compile
       |
       +---- Unit Test
       |
       +---- JaCoCo
       |
       +---- Package
       |
       v
WAR / JAR
       |
       v
Artifact Repository
       |
       v
QA
       |
       v
UAT
       |
       v
Production
```

