# Maven Core Concepts

```text
Maven
 |
 +-- pom.xml
 |
 +-- Dependencies
 |
 +-- Plugins
 |
 +-- Repositories
 |
 +-- Lifecycle
 |
 +-- Phases
 |
 +-- Goals
 |
 +-- Build Output
```

### `pom.xml`

Main Maven project configuration file.

### Dependency

External library required by the application.

### Plugin

Provides additional Maven functionality.

### Repository

Stores dependencies, plugins, and artifacts.

### Lifecycle

Defines the sequence of Maven build phases.

### Goal

An action that Maven can execute.

### Artifact

Build output such as JAR or WAR.

---

# Useful Maven Commands

```bash
# Check Maven version
mvn --version

# Compile
mvn compile

# Run unit tests
mvn test

# Package application
mvn package

# Clean build output
mvn clean

# Clean and package
mvn clean package

# Clean and install
mvn clean install

# Display effective POM
mvn help:effective-pom
```

