# Java Maven Web Application

A Java web application can be created using frameworks such as Spring Boot.

Example project:

```text
java-webapp-project/
|
├── src/
│   ├── main/
│   │   ├── java/
│   │   └── resources/
│   │
│   └── test/
│
├── target/
│
└── pom.xml
```

Training repository:

https://github.com/PL-DevOps-Cloud-2705/java-webapp-project

