# Quick Revision

```text
Build
  |
  +--> Compile Source Code
  +--> Run Tests
  +--> Create Artifact

Maven
  |
  +--> Java Build Tool
  +--> Dependency Management
  +--> Plugin Management
  +--> Build Automation

pom.xml
  |
  +--> Project Configuration
  +--> Dependencies
  +--> Plugins
  +--> Build Configuration

Jenkins
  |
  +--> CI/CD Orchestration

JUnit
  |
  +--> Unit Testing

JaCoCo
  |
  +--> Code Coverage

GitHub
  |
  +--> Source Code Repository

Artifact Repository
  |
  +--> Stores Build Artifacts
```

